gets_values": ["---\n\n## 1. 功能矩阵\n\nControlFoley 在一个统一框架内支持 5 种任务，全部通过同一个 Generator 节点实现，差异只在于「是否传 video / 是否传 ref_audio / 是否传 prompt」：\n\n| 任务 | 含义 | 必填输入 | 节点接线 | `mask_away_clip` |\n|------|------|----------|----------|------------------|\n| **TV2A** | 视频 + 文本 → 同步音效（Text-Video to Audio） | `video` + `prompt` | LoadVideo + 文本 → Generator | `false` |\n| **TC-V2A** | 文本主导（视频与文本语义冲突时跟文本走） | `video` + `prompt` | LoadVideo + 文本 → Generator | **`true`**（推荐） |\n| **AC-V2A** | 参考音频做音色迁移（Audio-Controlled） | `video` + `ref_audio` | LoadVideo + LoadAudio → Generator | `false` |\n| **V2A** | 纯视频驱动（无文本） | `video` | LoadVideo → Generator | `false` |\n| **T2A** | 纯文本生成音频（无视频） | `prompt` | 直接 → Generator | `false` |\n\n---"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [681.32763671875, 410.1727294921875], "pos": [-624.5009155273438, 764.7437744140625], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [12], "label": "浮点", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "浮点"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [153.93692016601562, 1079.934326171875], "widgets_values": [8.000000000000002], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "Float", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Float"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["提示词"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 101.84040832519531], "pos": [579.299560546875, 847.6504516601562], "id": 13, "properties": {}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["时长"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 101.84040832519531], "pos": [571.111572265625, 1044.380859375], "id": 14, "properties": {}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [11], 